    {
      "id": "claim_810c4ca72b6c408e885837fdb966b0ab",
      "statement": "Each gatus component variant generates a ConfigMap ${APP}-gatus-ep labeled gatus.io/enabled=true via configMapGenerator; the central Gatus deployment discovers these ConfigMaps by that label. The external variant probes https://${GATUS_SUBDOMAIN:=${APP}}.${SECRET_DOMAIN} for status 200; the guarded variant checks that the domain's DNS A record is unresolvable (len([BODY]) == 0).",
