      "id": "claim_44a9f477d165419390d2920481525000",
      "statement": "The image-automation component adds, per app, an ExternalSecret for registry credentials from Bitwarden, an ImageRepository scanning tags each minute, and an ImagePolicy labeled image-automation:enabled whose numerical policy extracts a timestamp from tags matching ^.+-[a-f0-9]+-(?P<ts>[0-9]+)$ to select the newest tag.",
