      "id": "claim_8dd55309e8d749cfae03f1431ef3d2cb",
      "statement": "The volsync component's PVC uses dataSourceRef ReplicationDestination volsync-dst-${APP} (trigger manual: restore-once) so the claim is seeded from the latest restic snapshot for migration/restore; volsync-new's claim.yaml omits the dataSourceRef, creating a fresh empty PVC while still shipping the same ReplicationSource and destination.",
